      "target": {
        "kind": "pull_request",
        "title": "fix(channels): honor configured read target policies",
        "body": "## What Problem This Solves\n\nFixes an issue where channel read actions could access conversations outside the targets allowed by the active account and room policies. This affected read-oriented actions in Matrix, Microsoft Teams, Feishu, and Google Chat, while Discord and Slack had adjacent read paths that needed the same invariant applied consistently.\n\n## Why This Change Was Made\n\nThis moves read authorization into each channel owner's action boundary and carries the native current-conversation context through the shared tool and harness layers. Read actions now resolve the target, classify it using the transport's authoritative API data, apply the same account and conversation policy used by ingress, and only then perform the read.\n\nThe change is AI-assisted. The implementation and behavior were reviewed against the full affected call paths, sibling channel implementations, tests, and provider contracts.\n\n## User Impact\n\nConfigured DM, group, room, space, team, and channel restrictions now apply to read, search, membership, reaction, pin, and information actions as appropriate for each channel. Reads in the current conversation continue to work, and explicitly configured cross-conversation reads remain available.\n\n## Evidence\n\n- Fresh local autoreview: no actionable findings; patch judged correct.\n- `pnpm build`\n- `pnpm tsgo:core`\n- `pnpm tsgo:core:test`\n- `pnpm tsgo:extensions`\n- `pnpm tsgo:extensions:test`\n- Focused and affected Vitest coverage across core tool context plus Discord, Slack, Matrix, Microsoft Teams, Feishu, Google Chat, Codex, and Copilot: 871 tests passed.\n- Blacksmith Testbox through Crabbox: `tbx_01kwnxyy233nf8q4yy5pzemqs5`, Actions run `28698116414`, exit 0.\n- Live Matrix before/after proof against disposable Tuwunel `v1.5.1` through the production Gateway `message.action` path:\n  - `origin/main` returned a seeded message from a configured-but-disabled secondary room.\n  - This branch rejected the identical read with `Matrix read target is not allowed` before room history was returned.\n  - The normal Matrix canary passed in both runs.\n",
        "branch": "fix/channel-read-policy-gates",
